% GregoBase 1143 written out in full (nine invocations), as in the Hymnal.
% Slur groups ("/"), bars and text follow the Vatican II Hymnal modern edition;
% the horizontal episemas (no "rit." in the Hymnal) are dropped, and the
% Hymnal's quarter bar after the first melisma of the last Kyrie is added
% (a larger space "//" in the square-notation editions).
% Pitches cross-checked against GregoBase 15890 (Graduale Romanum 1974).
